# Frontend Standards

## Components

- Function components (`export function Name()`); custom hooks start with `use`; strict prop interfaces.
- Keep modules near ≤300 lines; extract hooks, presentational pieces, schemas, and helpers instead of growing one file.
- `useMemo` / `useCallback` for referential stability in dependencies, not premature optimization.
- **Data fetching:** prefer Server Components / Server Actions (`createClient` from `@/lib/supabase/server`). In Client Components use `getSupabaseClient()` from `@/lib/supabase` and always handle the returned `error`.

## Styling

- Tailwind utilities + theme tokens from `src/styles/globals.css` (`bg-background`, `text-primary`, …); `cn()` for conditional classes; mobile-first.
- Light **and** dark mode must both work (`ThemeProvider` uses `defaultTheme="system"`). Use tokens, not hard-coded surface/text colors.
- Reuse `src/components/ui/*` (Shadcn/Radix) and animation helpers (`AnimatedSection`, `StaggerContainer`, `AnimatedCounter`, `Skeleton`) instead of re-implementing them.
- Avoid wrapper `<div>`s or Fragments that only carry one class or one child — move the class to parent, child, or `TableCell`. One `TooltipProvider` per section, not per row.

## Shadcn Select

- Never `<SelectItem value="">`. Optional fields use `undefined` in defaults and `value={field.value || undefined}`. Details: skill `veta-forms-validation`.

## Structure

- `src/app` routes/views · `src/components/ui` primitives · `src/components` domain components · `src/lib` utilities · `src/types` shared types.

Visual recipes (animation timing, hover, gradients, button widths): skill `veta-frontend-components`.
